profile=Quality
profile.comment=Quality. Low: short shadows, none from mobs, no reflections, no ambient occlusion. Medium: shadows, reflections and ambient occlusion. High: adds sun rays and longer shadows. Ultra: the sharpest, longest shadows.
profile.LOW=Low
profile.MEDIUM=Medium
profile.HIGH=High
profile.ULTRA=Ultra

option.SHADOWS=Shadows
option.SHADOWS.comment=The sun and moon cast shadows. The most expensive setting.
option.MOB_SHADOWS=Mob Shadows
option.MOB_SHADOWS.comment=Mobs, players, chests and other block entities cast shadows too. Off is faster where there are many of them.
option.PIXEL_SHADOWS=Pixel Shadows
option.PIXEL_SHADOWS.comment=Shadows fall in whole pixels, like the game's textures, with blocky edges instead of soft ones.
option.PIXEL_SHADOWS_SIZE=Shadow Pixels
option.PIXEL_SHADOWS_SIZE.comment=How many shadow pixels fit across a block. 16 matches the game's textures; fewer is chunkier. Needs Pixel Shadows.
value.PIXEL_SHADOWS_SIZE.4=4 per block
value.PIXEL_SHADOWS_SIZE.8=8 per block
value.PIXEL_SHADOWS_SIZE.16=16 per block
value.PIXEL_SHADOWS_SIZE.32=32 per block
value.PIXEL_SHADOWS_SIZE.64=64 per block
option.PIXEL_SHADOWS_SOFT=Soft Pixel Edges
option.PIXEL_SHADOWS_SOFT.comment=Pixels at a shadow's edge are partly dark, as much of them as is in shadow. Edges stay in whole pixels but no longer flicker as you move. Needs Pixel Shadows.
option.SHADOW_SOFTNESS=Shadow Blur
option.SHADOW_SOFTNESS.comment=Blurs shadow edges, which hides their shimmer as you move. More costs a little more. Not used with Pixel Shadows.
value.SHADOW_SOFTNESS.1=Off
value.SHADOW_SOFTNESS.2=Light
value.SHADOW_SOFTNESS.3=Medium
value.SHADOW_SOFTNESS.4=Heavy
option.COLORED_LIGHT=Colored Light
option.COLORED_LIGHT.comment=Torches light orange, soul fire blue, sea lanterns teal, amethyst purple, redstone red.
option.HAND_LIGHT=Hand Light
option.HAND_LIGHT.comment=A torch, lantern or other light held in either hand lights up what is around you, in its own color with Colored Light.
option.shadowMapResolution=Shadow Sharpness
option.shadowMapResolution.comment=Higher is sharper and slower.
value.shadowMapResolution.1024=Soft
value.shadowMapResolution.2048=Sharp
value.shadowMapResolution.4096=Sharpest
option.shadowDistance=Shadow Distance
option.shadowDistance.comment=How far out shadows are drawn. Further is slower.
option.sunPathRotation=Sun Path Tilt
option.sunPathRotation.comment=0 keeps the game's sun, straight overhead at noon. Tilt it to keep shadows long all day.
option.AMBIENT_OCCLUSION=Ambient Occlusion
option.AMBIENT_OCCLUSION.comment=Corners and crevices are a little darker.
option.SUN_RAYS=Sun Rays
option.SUN_RAYS.comment=Shafts of sunlight through trees, openings and haze. Needs Shadows.
option.SUN_RAYS_STRENGTH=Sun Ray Strength
option.SUN_RAYS_STRENGTH.comment=How thick the air is with sunlight. Strong and Insane also send shafts out past hills, trees and far-off terrain, all the way to the horizon.
value.SUN_RAYS_STRENGTH.1=Soft
value.SUN_RAYS_STRENGTH.2=Strong
value.SUN_RAYS_STRENGTH.3=Insane
option.WATER_REFLECTIONS=Water Reflections
option.WATER_REFLECTIONS.comment=Water reflects the land around it, not just the sky.
option.WAVING=Waving
option.WAVING.comment=Water ripples; leaves and plants sway.
option.BLOOM=Bloom
option.BLOOM.comment=A soft glow around bright things like the sun, lava and torches.
option.SMOOTH_EDGES=Smooth Edges
option.SMOOTH_EDGES.comment=Smooths jagged edges where one thing ends and another begins, leaving the blocks' own textures alone. Not used with FXAA.
option.FXAA=FXAA
option.FXAA.comment=Smooths jagged edges everywhere in the picture, textures too. A little softer than Smooth Edges. Can go with TAA, to smooth what it leaves.
option.TAA=TAA
option.TAA.comment=Temporal anti-aliasing: each frame is drawn shifted a little and blended with the ones before, for the smoothest edges and no shimmer on far-off blocks. Softens the picture: Sharpening brings it back.
option.SHARPENING=Sharpening
option.SHARPENING.comment=Sharpens the picture, most where it is flat and least across edges. Best with TAA, around 30 to 50%.
value.SHARPENING.0=Off
value.SHARPENING.10=10%
value.SHARPENING.20=20%
value.SHARPENING.30=30%
value.SHARPENING.40=40%
value.SHARPENING.50=50%
value.SHARPENING.60=60%
value.SHARPENING.70=70%
value.SHARPENING.80=80%
value.SHARPENING.90=90%
value.SHARPENING.100=100%
option.FOG_AMOUNT=Fog
option.FOG_AMOUNT.comment=A haze over the last part of what you can see, Distant Horizons' far terrain included: at 20% the last 20%. Higher brings it nearer. From there it thickens the further and lower things are, so valleys fill with mist. Off: fog only at the edge of what is drawn.
